        const objRiscoAudit = {"riscoAudits":[{"_id":"68b62595770a316df0a21cb1","risco":"Delay in task execution","resposta":"We accept the risk that has occurred and allocated time to do it.","impacto":4,"acao":3,"urgencia":4,"impactoFinanceiro":0,"impactoCronograma":7,"descricaoImpacto":"One of the tasks that was delayed was the pit display. Due to a problem with our computer, it took us longer to render the car that will be displayed on the pit canvas, which resulted in delays in the design, sponsor approval, and, most importantly, production. Other tasks, such as engineering, were also delayed, but nothing as significant as this one.","descricaoAvaliacao":"Although it impacted and delayed production, we were able to speak with our supplier, and the delay was a week, which had already been included as float. Therefore, the impact and urgency were less than we expected.","impactoPlano":5,"urgenciaPlano":5,"acaoPlano":3,"impactoFinanceiroPlano":0,"impactoCronogramaPlano":15},{"_id":"686bc64a4abc869863b4c39e","risco":"Failure to adhere to scruteneering rules","resposta":"We accept the risk that has occurred and take action to mitigate and/or resolve it.","impacto":4,"acao":4,"urgencia":5,"impactoFinanceiro":0,"impactoCronograma":3,"descricaoImpacto":"We had to remodel a component because it was out of the rule. It impacted our schedule and the quality.","descricaoAvaliacao":"We took more time remodeling it, but the previous ratings remained the same\t","impactoPlano":4,"urgenciaPlano":5,"acaoPlano":4,"impactoFinanceiroPlano":900,"impactoCronogramaPlano":5},{"_id":"68477ec5426f0e72da54129b","risco":"Invitations for marketing actions","resposta":"We shared the opportunity, including a sponsor as a collaborator of one of the actions and participated in the activities with commitment.","impacto":4,"acao":1,"urgencia":4,"impactoFinanceiro":0,"impactoCronograma":0,"descricaoImpacto":"It impacted the scope, adding more marketing and sustainability actions for the team, as well as the quality and reputation of the team. These were actions that created space for Alpha.","descricaoAvaliacao":"All assessments were maintained, because it was easy to take action in relation to the risk, and this really impacted us and required an urgent response, so that the risk could be taken advantage of.","impactoPlano":4,"urgenciaPlano":4,"acaoPlano":1,"impactoFinanceiroPlano":0,"impactoCronogramaPlano":7},{"_id":"68b62431c37318393c6cb4be","risco":"Invites from environmental-focused companies to partake in sustainable actions","resposta":"We exploti, participating in actions and learning more about sustainability\t","impacto":4,"acao":2,"urgencia":4,"impactoFinanceiro":0,"impactoCronograma":7,"descricaoImpacto":"We were able to participate in volunteering and reforestation activities, which impacted the team's sustainability.","descricaoAvaliacao":"This opportunity was very well taken advantage of by the team, who produced reports and content about the actions in partnership with IMA and other social institutions. It had a significant impact on the team's sustainability, but for some actions it was more difficult to take action, requiring more physical and human resources.","impactoPlano":3,"urgenciaPlano":4,"acaoPlano":1,"impactoFinanceiroPlano":0,"impactoCronogramaPlano":7},{"_id":"684780303bf93506fd4c8cd2","risco":"Invites to collaborate with bigger accounts in digital media","resposta":"We exploit the opportunity, participating in the collaboration.","impacto":5,"acao":3,"urgencia":3,"impactoFinanceiro":0,"impactoCronograma":15,"descricaoImpacto":"We are in contact with a very large Instagram profile in our region, which is a fan base for the football team. This has impacted our reach and possibilities for creating content and learning. Also, we did a collaboration in digital media with a driver of F1 Academy.","descricaoAvaliacao":"It had a bigger impact than we expected, our audience grew and we learned a lot about content creation. On the other hand, it demanded more from the team.","impactoPlano":4,"urgenciaPlano":3,"acaoPlano":2,"impactoFinanceiroPlano":0,"impactoCronogramaPlano":7},{"_id":"68cb3f585f3a7fbe77753d3d","risco":"Moderate weight of painting","resposta":".","impacto":1,"acao":1,"urgencia":1,"impactoFinanceiro":0,"impactoCronograma":0,"descricaoImpacto":".","descricaoAvaliacao":".","impactoPlano":3,"urgenciaPlano":1,"acaoPlano":1,"impactoFinanceiroPlano":0},{"_id":"686bc6d24abc869863b4c3a4","risco":"Parts non manufacturable","resposta":"We accept the risk that has occurred and take action to mitigate and/or resolve it.","impacto":4,"acao":3,"urgencia":5,"impactoFinanceiro":0,"impactoCronograma":7,"descricaoImpacto":"Chassis was larger than the STEAM Racing Model Block","descricaoAvaliacao":"It was more difficult to take action than we imagined, given that the problem was in the chassis itself, and the urgency was greater.","impactoPlano":4,"urgenciaPlano":3,"acaoPlano":1,"impactoFinanceiroPlano":0,"impactoCronogramaPlano":5},{"_id":"6866e4dd5f7a8437af69900b","risco":"Test the car on the track","resposta":"We had the \"enhance\" response, because besides testing, we could analyze results.","impacto":4,"acao":3,"urgencia":3,"impactoFinanceiro":0,"impactoCronograma":2,"descricaoImpacto":"It was possible to test the car on the track, carrying out several tests and obtaining information for the portfolio.","descricaoAvaliacao":"Previous ratings remained the same","impactoPlano":4,"urgenciaPlano":3,"acaoPlano":3,"impactoFinanceiroPlano":0,"impactoCronogramaPlano":15},{"_id":"68b626a0c37318393c6cb4c9","risco":"Uniform as a marketing material","resposta":"We exploit, producing uniforms for sale, and also share the impacted with our supplier, Adecore.","impacto":3,"acao":2,"urgencia":2,"impactoFinanceiro":0,"impactoCronograma":20,"descricaoImpacto":"Since we had designed our uniform a few weeks in advance, we also used it for sales. Many people asked us for a T-shirt in the style we used in the competition, so we made an exclusive one of the model that will be used in the World Finals. It impacted our marketing and made our identity strong. ","descricaoAvaliacao":"Although it impacted the enterprise area and the consolidation of our identity, the impact was moderate. Furthermore, it was more difficult to take action due to the need to design the t-shirt.","impactoPlano":4,"urgenciaPlano":2,"acaoPlano":1,"impactoFinanceiroPlano":50,"impactoCronogramaPlano":30}]}

